Broadridge Financial Solutions Inc.}{}}}\scaps0\caps0\cf21\expnd0\expndtw0\chbrdr\brdrnone\f6\fs21\i0\b
\~(NYSE:BR) has been awarded a new U.S. patent on its large language model (LLM) orchestration of machine learning agents. These patented methods and systems are behind BondGPT, Broadridge\u8217\'92s award-winning GenAI application first demonstrated in the market in the LTX e-trading platform, a Broadridge subsidiary. BondGPT was\~}{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://www.ltxtrading.com/ltx-by-broadridge-launches-bondgpt-powered-by-openai-gpt-4" }{\fldrslt {\cf19\ulc0\scaps0\caps0\strike0\expnd0\expndtw0\animtext0\chbrdr\brdrnone\f6\fs21\i0\ulnone\b
released}{}}}\scaps0\caps0\cf21\expnd0\expndtw0\chbrdr\brdrnone\f6\fs21\i0\b
\~in June 2023, followed by the enterprise version,\~}{{\field{\*\fldinst HYPERLINK "https://www.ltxtrading.com/ltx-by-broadridge-launches-bondgptplus" }{\fldrslt {\cf19\ulc0\scaps0\caps0\strike0\expnd0\expndtw0\animtext0\chbrdr\brdrnone\f6\fs21\i0\ulnone\b
BondGPT+}{}}}\scaps0\caps0\cf21\expnd0\expndtw0\chbrdr\brdrnone\f6\fs21\i0\b
, in October 2023. These applications provide timely, secure and accurate responses to natural language questions using OpenAI GPT models and the orchestration of multiple AI agents to automatically retrieve and process data from multiple datasets and analytical models simultaneously.}
