\u8220\'93}{\scaps0\caps0\cf21\expnd0\expndtw0\chbrdr\brdrnone\f6\fs21\i0\b
We are consistently developing innovative data science and execution capabilities to improve our clients\u8217\'92 pre-trade and trade execution workflows,\u8221\'94 said Jim Kwiatkowski, CEO of LTX. \u8220\'93As we reflect on the positive feedback we\u8217\'92ve received about the value and uniqueness of BondGPT, it\u8217\'92s validating to receive this patent for our innovations. We will continue to work closely with clients integrating AI into their workflows to increase productivity and optimize trading.\u8221\'94}
{\scaps0\caps0\cf21\expnd0\expndtw0\chbrdr\brdrnone\par}\pard\plain \s18\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\ql\widctlpar\fi0\li0\lin0\ri0\rin0\sb0\sa0\brdrt\brdrnone\brdrl\brdrnone\brdrb\brdrnone\brdrr\brdrnone\ltrpar{\scaps0\caps0\cf21\expnd0\expndtw0\chbrdr\brdrnone\f6\fs21\i0\b
BondGPT and BondGPT+ harness powerful AI and machine learning to offer enhanced, personalized trading capabilities to corporate bond traders, portfolio managers, and analysts on the buy- and sell-side. By deploying Broadridge\u8217\'92s patented methods for LLM orchestration of machine learning agents, the BondGPT+ enterprise application integrates clients\u8217\'92 proprietary data and analytical models, third-party datasets, as well as sophisticated personalization features, and provides unparalleled access to critical pre-trade data and models, improving efficiency and saving valuable time for users.}
